{"ID":"20230926145024-ziczyt7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230926145024-ziczyt7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145024-ziczyt7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145027-3gc0im1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145027-p7ivw16\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230926145027-p7ivw16\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:26,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:26\u0026#125;","title":"【百合知母汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230926145027"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230926145027-3gc0im1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145027-3gc0im1","updated":"20230926145027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：百合七枚、知母三两"}]},{"ID":"20230926145027-pm4kpte","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145027-pm4kpte","updated":"20230926145027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右二味，先以水洗百合，渍一宿，当白沫出，去其水，另取泉水二升，煮别以泉水二升煮知母，取一升，去滓；后合煎，取一升五合，分温再服。"}]},{"ID":"20230926145027-p7ivw16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230926145027-p7ivw16","updated":"20230926145027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【13.2】百合病，见于发汗之后者，百合知母汤主之。"}]}]}